      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is kind of tangent to this CL, but why do we have a static factory here but still have all the fields public. Looking at the implementation, it doesn\u0027t even look like the Make call can fail. Should this just be a normal ctor? Also its a little strange that all the fields are public but don\u0027t have any default initialization if you don\u0027t call the factory.",
